WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.860
Good morning, Hank!

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.160
It is Tuesday, November 8th, 2016.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.160
It’s Pizzamas!

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.150
The most magical time of the year!

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:11.210
So, every year during Pizzamas, we make videos
on vlogbrothers every weekday for two weeks.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:14.840
Unfortunately, Hank, you scheduled the arrival
of your child poorly and you’re on paternity leave.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:15.840
What’s that?

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:18.280
Oh, apparently you can’t schedule the arrival
of a child.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:23.380
But Pizzamas is full of magic, and so as part
of that, you managed to somehow upload a video

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.850
during your paternity leave.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:28.020
Not just a video, by the way, but a video
with you dancing in it.

00:00:28.029 --> 00:00:29.539
That’s my favorite kind of vlogbrothers
video.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:33.520
Did you know that Hank Green was named Winter
Park High School’s Best Dancer in 1998?

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.020
It’s true.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.060
Wait, what just happened to my face?

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:36.340
It’s a Pizzamas miracle!

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.220
My mustache is back!

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.770
Also, in totally predictable news, I have
cut myself shaving.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.870
By the way, I have been growing a beard for
two months for this joke, so I hope you enjoy

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.280
how ridiculous I look.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.440
So the Pizza John story is so complicated
that I can’t even really bring myself to

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.920
explain it to new nerdfighters, but Hank made
a video a while back with the highlights.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:56.330
But basically, every year there’s a bunch
of limited edition Pizza John merch, like

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.190
this year there’s this La Croix Pizza John.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:00:59.550
There’s also this Pizza John hoodie.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:02.840
Hank reached out to a bunch of his favorite
T-shirt designers, and many of them designed

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.180
awesome Pizza John shirts.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.960
You can find them all at dftba.com.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:10.360
Also, all the Pizza John stuff is only available
during Pizzamas, and then it will disappear forever.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.820
Ugh, God, I just look so bad with this mustache.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:17.670
I look like a 39-year-old man impersonating
a nine-year-old impersonating a police officer.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:21.490
It’s even worse than the one from last year,
but you never know what gifts Pizzamas is gonna bring.

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:24.300
Wait a second, hold up, back up the tape for
a second.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.270
Did I just say, “It is Tuesday, November
8th, 2016”?

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.340
November 8th, why is that date important?

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:33.400
Oh right, it’s because the Pizza John PJs
are being made right here in Indianapolis

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.260
on November 8th.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.560
I actually prefer to call them the PJ PJs.

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.300
Alright, I gotta head over to the pajama factory.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:41.010
And for better or worse, I’m taking my mustache
with me.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.900
Quick story: I didn’t get this on video
because I’m a bad vlogger who’s terrified

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.280
of pulling out his camera in public places
except for airports, but I just got a cup

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:50.330
of coffee, and after I ordered, the woman
behind the counter said, “I mustache you

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:54.470
if you would like room for cream,” and I
just wanna say for the record, well played.

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:56.770
Alright, Hank, I’ve arrived at Krazy Klothes!

00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:58.140
Time to go see my pajamas!

00:01:58.150 --> 00:01:59.150
I’m John, nice to meet you.

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:00.150
Hi, John, nice to meet you.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:03.680
So first Debby lays out the fabric, then it
goes through this amazing machine, where it

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.860
is imprinted with my mustachioed face.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:09.990
Now, there are some parts of the process that
are automated, but every pair of Pizza John

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:14.320
pajamas is cut and sewn by hand right here
in Indianapolis.

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:16.880
And when they’re all done, they look like
this.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.960
I think that’s all I had scheduled for November
8th.

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.580
Just kidding, I have to go vote.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.340
I already texted myself my sample ballot.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:25.400
By the way, on my phone, I’ve got this great
Pizza John popsocket.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.960
It’s so useful! Never not self-promoing.

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.780
Quick side note: If you’re an American and
you can vote, listen to the man with the mustache.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:33.200
Look up your polling place in the dooblydoo.

00:02:33.209 --> 00:02:37.869
If you need a refresher on anything you might
need to bring to the polls, go to youtube.com/howtovoteineverystate

00:02:37.869 --> 00:02:38.829
and look up your state.

00:02:38.829 --> 00:02:39.889
And go vote!

00:02:39.889 --> 00:02:40.669
You can do this!

00:02:40.669 --> 00:02:43.959
I’m about to do it with a mustache, wearing
a portrait of myself with a mustache.

00:02:43.959 --> 00:02:45.979
Okay, I’m on my way into my polling place.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.200
And now I have voted.

00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:50.089
Again, if you need voting resources, you can
find some in the dooblydoo below.

00:02:50.089 --> 00:02:52.620
Happy Pizzamas, and happy Election Day!

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:57.130
I’m not gonna lie, I’m a little bit nervous,
but I’m just—I’m just trying to keep my cool.

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:58.840
Who am I kidding, I’m a lot bit nervous.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:02.520
Hank, I will not see you tomorrow, but I’ll
see somebody on vlogbrothers.

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:03.480
Vote!

